#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "A flexible, accessible WordPress theme built for the Castle Rock Repeater Group amateur radio club. Includes a configurable front page (hero, info bar, feature cards, latest posts, call to action), three header layouts, an optional top bar, sticky header, five content layouts (right / left / no sidebar, dual sidebars, full width) selectable globally, per content type and per page, fourteen widget areas, five menu locations, logo-based colour presets (orange, charcoal and white), a bundled CRRG badge logo, Google or system fonts, club-specific widgets (repeaters, net schedule, contact, call to action) and block patterns."
msgstr ""

